; Regression (2026-10-10): a routine written TWICE in one namespace, same name
; and same parameter list -- a helper added under a name the namespace already
; had. The first body answers every call and nothing says so; the tool met it
; as a suite gone red with no line to look at.
; xfail: error: function twice of tools is written twice with one parameter list

define tools
{
    function twice(n: int) returns int
        n * 2

    function twice(n: int) returns int
        n * 3
}

print("`tools.twice(7)`")
